    title: 'Merge Rush Rules: How to Play the Triple-Merge Game',
    metaTitle: 'Merge Rush Rules: Learn the Triple Merge',
    metaDescription: 'Learn Merge Rush rules, tile movement, triple merges, level goals and endless mode before you start this free browser puzzle and play at your own pace.',
