    title: 'Merge Rush Strategy: Plan Triple Merges and Save Space',
    metaTitle: 'Merge Rush Strategy for Bigger Merges',
    metaDescription: 'Use a practical Merge Rush strategy to group matching tiles, protect open lanes and build powers of three without jamming the board or losing space.',
